<title>UK: Korea Exchange Bank sets $100 million one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Exchange Bank sets $100 million one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Fuji International Finance Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA EXCHANGE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	SPREAD     0.20	MATURITY    02.OCT.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   0.05</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.975</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.02	SELL CONC  0.03	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
